# No Vite env vars. Account-code filters, app title (`app.title`), workflow
# toggles, and publish policy come from Strapi (Settings + GET /api/backoffice/config).
# Local API: always http://localhost:1337. Production: window.location.origin.
# Seed per instance (httpyac; Full access API token in http-client.private.env.json):
#   npm run seed:http:kor:backoffice-features:local
